    <item>
      <title>SHAP-based Feature Importance Aggregation Across MRI Modalities</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1314/project/paper-4/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1314/project/paper-4/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;We propose a principled framework for aggregating SHAP-based feature importance scores across rsfMRI, dMRI, and sMRI modalities for group classification. Our method addresses selection bias, double-counting, and uncertainty quantification in multimodal neuroimaging studies.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
